	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010040c"},
		line=917,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Lunch break.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A major incident has occurred in the cafeteria─",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Empress Hisui has come to eat.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Everyone, I am here today as just another ordinary student.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“There is no need to afford me any special treatment. Please carry on as you always do.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"When she says this at the entrance, her escorting guards silently make themselves scarce.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Seems like she really intends to act as a student.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She gonna be okay?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looks like the students acting as her tour guide have stepped back, at least.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"The first obstacle is the buffet.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Albeit with some perplexion, Empress Hisui manages to place food on her plate.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"She has probably never been in the position of selecting her own meal.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Come to think of it, has today's food even been tasted for poison?",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"The more I watch on, the more agitated I become.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's rude to stare, bro.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're right.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She did say to act like we always do.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Akari is also trying her best to not act conscious of her.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"To Akari, Empress Hisui is her own impostor.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Though not as much as Okonogi, she clearly bears some amount of resentment against her.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Akari casts her sharp gaze upwards.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She's still in a bad mood.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks for holding it in.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not that childish.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"With that brusque remark, she digs into her agedashi tofu.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"We both chose the same meal.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"How cheap... This tofu is awfully cheap.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Not to mention, the flavor of the frying oil is rather lacking.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"They really should have just gone with cold tofu.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"But they always only ever offer scallions as an accompaniment.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I'm a diehard ginger man myself, and you couldn't call yourself a warrior if you'd compromise there on...",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Hotori raises a sharp voice.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Following her gaze, I see a group of Republicans starting a photo shoot with Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The Republicans point their cell phone cameras at whatever interests them, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"as",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"they always do.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Taking personal pictures of Her Majesty would be unthinkable for an Imperial.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"But Republicans don't understand this sentiment.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"In fact, there's even a possibility they're taking pictures of Empress Hisui as a way of showing their goodwill.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Sure enough, the cafeteria begins buzzing with commotion.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Because of the cultural differences, our displeasure\ndoesn't get through to the Republicans.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The crowd of photographers expands more and more.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Until at last, one of the students stands shoulder to shoulder with Empress Hisui and makes a rabbit ear shape with her fingers.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"I grab Hotori's arm and hold her back.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let me go!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't do it.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"A few Imperial students try to tear the photographers away.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"And thus the arrow of pandemonium is loosed.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ahahaha, they finally snapped, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Kotone, which side d'ya think is gonna win?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawawawawa...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Their frustration must have reached a boiling point, as the outnumbered Imperials make up for it with their determination.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, I'm getting Empress Hisui out of there.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Please.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, try not to get yourself hurt.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I leap over the table and plunge into the middle of the melee.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, hold it!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“*Glomp!*”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Kotone! Why are you hugging me?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You shall not pass. You shall not pass, I say!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Now, now, why don't we all just sit back and watch the show?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, come on!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I weave through the gaps between people.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"I deftly dodge the occasional flying fist or elbow without returning blows.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"I shouldn't rock the boat any more than necessary.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I dodge the incoming fist of a soldier-looking fellow.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"After lightly sidestepping the last person blocking the way, I leap and land right in front of Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Nnh?!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Empress Hisui trembles with a start.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, it is not safe here. Please allow me to take you away.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“*Gasp!*”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"She meets me with a gaze of pure astonishment.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Is it even possible for someone to be this shocked?",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Her body is frozen stiffer than a wax figure, and she's stopped breathing entirely.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My apologies!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Eh?!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I lift Empress Hisui in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Prior to meeting Akari, I would never have dreamed of laying a hand on Her Majesty without hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take care not to bite your tongue.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I step atop a nearby table and leap off.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"With a single bound, I clear the crucible of chaos below.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I'd thought her frozen in fear, but Empress Hisui's countenance appears tinged with enjoyment at the present situation.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Seeing the innocence of her expression inexplicably puts my own heart at ease.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Unmistakably, I feel a sense of kindred familiarity at the sight of her smile.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I alight at a spot near the exit of the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"I move to set Empress Hisui down, but her thin arms are still wrapped tightly around my neck.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"The soft touch I feel is unmistakably that of a woman.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, the danger has passed.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Huh? So soon?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Er... Ahem!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"As soon as I set Empress Hisui down, her guards who were caught up in the chaos come rushing over.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"They insert themselves between the two of us, as though insinuating I'm a threat.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Stand down. This gentleman came to my aid.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Empress Hisui calls off her guards.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"As a show of etiquette, I kneel before Her Majesty.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, please forgive my sudden impertinence.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Pay it no mind. Indeed, I ought to be extending you my sincerest gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Thank you kindly for rescuing me.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your praise honors me.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I lower my head further.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I should like to repay your valor. Have you any desires I might fulfill?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nay, that was but a warrior's...”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I nearly answered on reflex, but reconsider.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I can use this to my advantage.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If it pleases you...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I withdraw a Koujiya Flowers business card from my wallet and present it to Empress Hisui via a bodyguard.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Koujiya Flowers... A flower shop?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shameful as it is to admit, this is my present place of employment.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Would that we might be humbly permitted to arrange but a single bouquet for Your Majesty, there could be no greater honor.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very well. I shall certainly be sure to contact you.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Might you be knowledgeable of my favorite flower, kind sir?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I'm not.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"This is the height of negligence.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Flowers are my livelihood, and yet I am ignorant even of Her Majesty's preferences.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Though to be fair, “Her Majesty” is ultimately an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I must confess my ignorance. I humbly beg your forgiveness.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I suppose that was a rather shameless thing to ask of you.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"In contrast with her cheerful smile, her eyes betray a forlorn loneliness.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"To think that she is someone capable of such mysterious expressions.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I know full well that she is Akari's enemy, yet I can't help but take an interest in her character.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would ask for a forget-me-not.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Forget-me-not.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Those words stir up a long-forgotten feeling within my chest.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"A gentle and refreshing breeze, passing through a field of spring.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As you wish.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"So ends my conversation with Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, one more moment, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Empress Hisui turns and looks my way.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon, but would I be mistaken in believing that Your Majesty has perchance graced me with an audience in the past?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ask this because I have lost my previous memories due to injuries I sustained during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I should have lost even my recollections of such an honor as an audience with Your Majesty, I can only offer my paltry words of apology.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"I ask with the utmost humility.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"As Empress Hisui gazes at me, the corners of her eyes moisten ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have not.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you very much for deigning to answer me.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I pray from the bottom of my heart that your memories might someday return.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am unworthy of such kindness.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"As I bow my head, Empress Hisui, surrounded by her guards, withdraws from the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Phew...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"All the tension evacuates my body.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"It seems like I really was just imagining things, and Her Majesty doesn't actually know me.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Even still, our meeting wasn't without profit.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"If all goes well, we may be able to deliver flowers to the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"As long as I can get my foot in the door, we'll be in business.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I just hope the order comes in.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Now...",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I turn around to find that the brawl between the Imperials and Republicans is still in full swing.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"By the look of things, there are nearly a hundred students embroiled in the back-and-forth melee.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"The president must have decided to just let things play out, as she's merely standing and watching from afar.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Hotori rushes up to me.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I evacuated Empress Hisui without incident.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank goodness.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If it weren't for my position, I would've jumped in myself. How frustrating...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Being able to restrain yourself is just another part of your job.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"I pat Hotori on the back.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Now, what should we do about all this?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What else can we do but let things play out?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"The moment Hotori shrugs her head, the firewalls on the outer windows fall down with a violent thud.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The lights cut out, and the cafeteria is enveloped in pitch black.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Everyone freezes within the sudden darkness.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Attentioooooon!”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"A voice like lightning rends through the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"A thunderous voice which shakes the very foundations of the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Much as all beasts instinctually fear lightning, the fighting spirit of every last brawler is quelled by that voice.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"A few select lights come on and its master is brought into view.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"She looks down from a position on high.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Every last pair of eyes in the room is inexorably drawn to her.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Imperials, I ask you!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Her Majesty requested that we carry on as we always do.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though the Republicans may display their boorish irreverence, who dares to put Her Majesty's accommodating benevolence to waste?!”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The deafening silence is answer enough.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Republicans, I ask you!”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though the student council president tried to take control of the situation, who dares to defy her will?!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your insolence besmirches the president's good name!”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Akari summons her voice out of her entire body to make her appeal.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"With her back arched like a drawn bow, her bearing is as radiantly beautiful as a phoenix soaring into the sun.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"With a single gesture, she instantly dispels the oppressive atmosphere of violence suffocating the room.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Figuratively, to be sure.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"But Akari has the strength of presence to make it feel literal.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Both sides, I ask you!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you believe your conduct here to befit proud human beings!?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Akari's voice continues to reverberate throughout the cafeteria.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"In that moment, I see it before my very eyes.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"A vision of Akari boldly rallying her forces on the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"And a vision of myself, standing at her right hand before fearlessly charging the enemy lines.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"The entire cafeteria is once again bathed in light.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"The quarreling students look like they've all just woken from a collective trance.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I might very well be wearing the exact same expression.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now then, everyone, do take care to follow the\npresident's directions from here on out.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"With that, Akari ends her address.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"The air of discord has completely dissipated from the room.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"As though remembering how they ought to behave, every last student obediently returns to their seat.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“First the Warrior District and now this. That girl's sure got a lot of guts.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Finally noticed, did you?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mmh...”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"I smile at Hotori's pouting expression, and we return to our original seats.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was incredible, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well? Am I amazing, or what?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Akari puffs out her chest.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All joking aside, I'm super relieved it managed to work out.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I just went ahead with it without really thinking it through.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Still, girl, that was pretty damn awesome.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Makes me want to poach you for our Group in the future.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, stop it.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Akari smiles bashfully.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Me! Me! I was the mastermind responsible for the lighting!”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
